Restrict the Automatic Translation tab to this module's own permission

On Drupal 11.4.0+, the content_translation access_callback became the
"service:method" string "content_translation.manager:access", which plain
call_user_func() cannot resolve, throwing:
"TypeError: call_user_func(): Argument #1 ($callback) must be a valid callback,
function 'content_translation.manager:access' not found or invalid function
name" at AutoNodeTranslateAccessCheck.php:57 on Drupal 11.4.1.

Resolving and calling that callback (an OR-clause) grants the Automatic
Translation tab to every role that can otherwise translate content
(create/update/delete content translations, or "translate editable entities").
Instead, gate access solely on this module's own
"auto translate {bundle} {entity_type}" permission. This fixes the TypeError and
keeps the tab restricted to the roles the site explicitly grants it to.

Issue: https://www.drupal.org/project/auto_node_translate/issues/3609236

--- a/src/Access/AutoNodeTranslateAccessCheck.php
+++ b/src/Access/AutoNodeTranslateAccessCheck.php
@@ -49,22 +49,18 @@
     if ($entity && $entity->isTranslatable()) {
       // Get entity base info.
       $bundle = $entity->bundle();
-
-      // Get entity access callback.
       $definition = $this->entityTypeManager->getDefinition($entity_type_id);
-      $translation = $definition->get('translation');
-      $access_callback = $translation['content_translation']['access_callback'];
-      $access = call_user_func($access_callback, $entity);
-      if ($access->isAllowed()) {
-        return $access;
-      }

-      // Check per entity permission.
+      // Gate access solely on this module's own "auto translate" permission so
+      // the Automatic Translation tab is not exposed to every role that can
+      // otherwise translate content. The content_translation access_callback
+      // OR-clause was intentionally removed here; see issue #3609236. This also
+      // avoids the call_user_func() TypeError on the "service:method" callback.
       $permission = "auto translate {$entity_type_id}";
       if ($definition->getPermissionGranularity() == 'bundle') {
         $permission = "auto translate {$bundle} {$entity_type_id}";
       }
-      return AccessResult::allowedIfHasPermission($account, $permission)->inheritCacheability($access);
+      return AccessResult::allowedIfHasPermission($account, $permission);
     }

     // No opinion.
